Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell[TextData[{
 "Linear waves in a plucked string with tied ends.\n\nThe string is symmetric \
and has a central region and two lateral regions with propagation velocity ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox["c", "p"]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.9537072619306593`*^9, 3.953707379824307*^9}, {
   3.9537121112803307`*^9, 3.953712116122335*^9}, {3.953716686703291*^9, 
   3.953716687004586*^9}, {3.953717957751033*^9, 3.9537179966052027`*^9}, {
   3.953722146240797*^9, 3.953722166380665*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "97f9c5b9-5ebd-4b26-9bd5-47ed213b9dc7"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox["c", "c"]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.9537072619306593`*^9, 3.953707379824307*^9}, {
   3.9537121112803307`*^9, 3.953712116122335*^9}, {3.953716686703291*^9, 
   3.953716687004586*^9}, {3.953717957751033*^9, 3.9537179966052027`*^9}, {
   3.953722146240797*^9, 3.953722166380665*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "6d9f0154-b480-4ec7-8be5-6daa36281d38"],
 ", respectively.\n\nWe place the x-axis along the string. Then, the central \
region is given by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"-", 
    SubscriptBox["x", "p"]}], "<=", "x", "<=", 
   SubscriptBox["x", "p"]}]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.9537072619306593`*^9, 3.953707379824307*^9}, {
   3.9537121112803307`*^9, 3.953712116122335*^9}, {3.953716686703291*^9, 
   3.953716687004586*^9}, {3.953717957751033*^9, 3.9537179966052027`*^9}, {
   3.953722146240797*^9, 3.953722166380665*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "5a9f4733-ba2d-4b01-bd70-039e103cd7ef"],
 " and the two lateral regions are given by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"-", 
    SubscriptBox["x", "c"]}], "<=", "x", "<=", 
   RowBox[{"-", 
    SubscriptBox["x", "p"]}]}]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.9537072619306593`*^9, 3.953707379824307*^9}, {
   3.9537121112803307`*^9, 3.953712116122335*^9}, {3.953716686703291*^9, 
   3.953716687004586*^9}, {3.953717957751033*^9, 3.9537179966052027`*^9}, {
   3.953722146240797*^9, 3.953722166380665*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "bd4ad6a9-a84f-44a0-93bd-b945f563b3ab"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["x", "p"], "<=", "x", "<=", 
   SubscriptBox["x", "c"]}]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.9537072619306593`*^9, 3.953707379824307*^9}, {
   3.9537121112803307`*^9, 3.953712116122335*^9}, {3.953716686703291*^9, 
   3.953716687004586*^9}, {3.953717957751033*^9, 3.9537179966052027`*^9}, {
   3.953722146240797*^9, 3.953722166380665*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "33c8943b-6347-4987-ab11-4df5608a3494"],
 ".\n\nIn each region, the perturbed velocity is of the form:\nv[x] = A Cos[k \
x] + B Sin[k x],\nwhere k = \[Omega]/c; c stands for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox["c", "p"]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.9537072619306593`*^9, 3.953707379824307*^9}, {
   3.9537121112803307`*^9, 3.953712116122335*^9}, {3.953716686703291*^9, 
   3.953716687004586*^9}, {3.953717957751033*^9, 3.9537179966052027`*^9}, {
   3.953722146240797*^9, 3.953722166380665*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "d9bdaa1b-ff42-4caa-822d-6cf54818261a"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox["c", "c"]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.9537072619306593`*^9, 3.953707379824307*^9}, {
   3.9537121112803307`*^9, 3.953712116122335*^9}, {3.953716686703291*^9, 
   3.953716687004586*^9}, {3.953717957751033*^9, 3.9537179966052027`*^9}, {
   3.953722146240797*^9, 3.953722166380665*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "a2e8487f-7550-45e3-9e84-e20386b9da7f"],
 ".\n\nSince the string is symmetric and the wave equation is symmetric, too, \
the function v[x] is either even or odd about x = 0. This symmetry condition \
is imposed with the help of the logical variable EvenParity."
}], "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.953728263160639*^9, 3.953728612160108*^9}, {
  3.9537291280600033`*^9, 
  3.9537291793467903`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"188a8b28-a8fa-43f2-b2c8-\
81fc624ecbeb"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "\"\<Global`*\>\"", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.953707244732436*^9, 3.95370724832826*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",ExpressionUUID->"5750e280-8b5f-4061-b266-065589ab73e6"],

